adaptation = "The report uses Wind All A free-float-cap-weighted market returns. The implementation uses lagged circ_mv weights within the available daily universe because free_share is outside the FactorFrame contract. Historical suspended sessions are removed, at least 100 valid sessions are required, beta is clipped to [-3,3], and each completed month-end estimate is exposed throughout the following calendar month."
